   "upstream": "# Release Notes — v5.1.1 — Performance and bug fixes\n\n---\n\n## Overview\n\nThis release adds small improvment for metadata console, caching performance, and minor bug fixes.\n\n- Fix: Enable Toggling Restrict values for TagCloud on/off [WPB-29504](https://wearezeta.atlassian.net/browse/WPB-29504).\n- Perf: PolicyGroup concurrent-safe Caching memoization [WPB-28683](https://wearezeta.atlassian.net/browse/WPB-28683).\n- Fix: Policy concurrent map in policy dao.\n- Security: Updates for dependency vulnerabilities.\n- Maintenance: Update the Go toolchain to version 1.27.3. \n## Change log\n\nYou can find [a summary of the change log here](https://github.com/pydio/cells/compare/v5.1.0...v5.1.1).",
